# INVWIN8.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: deleting
# locations.  DEL asks first, naming the location, its default answer
# No: N keeps it; Y on Box B2, which holds items, is refused by the
# server in a message box, the tree unchanged; a location added empty
# inside it is deleted, the tree fetched again with its selection on
# the row it had; the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWIN8.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-L B END DEL
S ASK
K N
S KEPT
K DEL Y
S HELD
K ENTER
S STILL
K INS
T Tray Z9
K TAB HOME
T BB
K ENTER
S ADDED
K END DEL
S ASKZ9
K Y
S DELETED
K ALT-F X
